# RDMS: WereWamp™

## Record Definition

```
TABLE: werewamp_class
  class_name      VARCHAR(64)   "WereWamp™"
  class_type      VARCHAR(32)   "Stealth"
  guild           VARCHAR(64)   "Ownership Guild"
  slaughter_turns INT           9
  ownership_mode  VARCHAR(64)   "PlayersSpeak™"
  actual_required BOOLEAN       FALSE
  checkout_req    BOOLEAN       FALSE
  checkin_req     BOOLEAN       FALSE
  divine_priv     BOOLEAN       TRUE

TABLE: werewamp_targets
  target_type     VARCHAR(32)   "UnDead™"
  condition       ENUM("timed_out", "non_ally")

TABLE: known_werewamps
  player_name     VARCHAR(128)  "Olivia Tiedemann"
  title           VARCHAR(64)   "Terrible of Man"
  status          VARCHAR(32)   "Active"
```

## Keys

- public.key: Authorization key (present = operational)
- safety.key: Safety verification key (present = safe operational state)
